WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.175
Let’s walk through Responses.

00:00:02.175 --> 00:00:05.550
Separate White Cell rulings, update notices, forwarded items

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.425
, and general communications.

00:00:07.425 --> 00:00:10.525
Bring material information back into the owning team workflow before

00:00:10.525 --> 00:00:12.475
changing a durable artifact.

00:00:12.475 --> 00:00:15.238
On this slide, read White Cell answers, update

00:00:15.238 --> 00:00:18.938
notices, forwarded proposals, and explicit communications.

00:00:18.938 --> 00:00:22.675
In practice, bring material new information back into deliberation

00:00:22.675 --> 00:00:24.700
before changing the team record.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.375
When you are ready, use Open Responses to move

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:28.788
to the live surface.

00:00:29.285 --> 00:00:31.960
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:32.135
.
